Write a Java program to find the sum of all elements in a doubly linked list.

Program:

class Main {
    static class Node {
        int data;
        Node prev, next;
        Node(int d) { data = d; }
    }


    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Node a = new Node(10);
        Node b = new Node(20);
        Node c = new Node(30);


        a.next = b;
        b.prev = a;
        b.next = c;
        c.prev = b;


        int sum = 0;
        while (a != null) {
            sum += a.data;
            a = a.next;
        }


        System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
    }
}

Input:

10 20 30

Output:

Sum = 60


2) Write a Java program to find the maximum element in a doubly linked list.

Program:

