    static class Node {
        int data;
        Node prev, next;
        Node(int d) { data = d; }
    }


    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Node a = new Node(10);
        Node b = new Node(50);
        Node c = new Node(30);


        a.next = b;
        b.prev = a;
        b.next = c;
        c.prev = b;


        int max = a.data;


        while (a != null) {
            if (a.data > max)
                max = a.data;
            a = a.next;
        }


        System.out.println("Maximum = " + max);
    }
}

Input:

10 50 30

Output:

Maximum = 50


3) Print Elements in Reverse Order

Question:
Write a Java program to print the elements of a doubly linked list in reverse order.

Program:

