4) Sort the Doubly Linked List

Question:
Write a Java program to sort the elements of a doubly linked list in ascending order.

Program:

class Main {
    static class Node {
        int data;
        Node prev, next;
        Node(int d) { data = d; }
    }


    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Node a = new Node(30);
        Node b = new Node(10);
        Node c = new Node(20);


        a.next = b;
        b.prev = a;
        b.next = c;
        c.prev = b;


        for (Node i = a; i != null; i = i.next)
            for (Node j = i.next; j != null; j = j.next)
                if (i.data > j.data) {
                    int t = i.data;
                    i.data = j.data;
                    j.data = t;
                }


        for (Node i = a; i != null; i = i.next)
            System.out.print(i.data + " ");
    }
}

Input:

30 10 20

Output:

10 20 30


